>Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.poster.avif?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.webm?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.mp4?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/9158f69580d49e3528e70d7520b6a82f.webp?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure—just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.                </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.poster.avif?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.webm?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.mp4?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/37b19703bb1630191281a58163377dda.webp?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don’t forget the little yard above—it’s yours to decorate and shape however you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.poster.avif?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.webm?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.mp4?t=1788836949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/e3afcd0921cb5f76fabaf6a4ccdfda52.webp?t=1788836949\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest crops for fresh bar ingredients, assisted by magical garden spirits. Store your harvest and unlock special hidden menu items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extr